PROJECT: Grass

## Ecosystem Position
Primary Sector: DePIN (Decentralized Physical Infrastructure Network) — Bandwidth Sharing & Web Data Scraping
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]; [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/grass]
Secondary Sector: AI Data Layer — Structured Data Provisioning for LLM Training & Inference
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/data-sales]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]
Primary Chain: Solana
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Explorer, https://explorer.solana.com/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-token-launch/]; [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/grass]
Supported Chains: Solana (Native); Ethereum, Arbitrum, Base, Polygon (via Wormhole Bridge — Planned/Active for token bridging only)
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Wormhole, https://wormhole.com/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/token-bridging/]; [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/grass]

## External Dependencies
Dependency Name: Solana
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: Settlement layer for GRASS token (SPL), staking, governance, rollup state anchoring, and validator consensus
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Solana
Related Technology Component: SVM (Solana Virtual Machine), SPL Token Program, Staking Program, Governance Program, Rollup Verifier Program
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Docs, https://solana.com/docs]; [Grass Docs Architecture, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/settlement]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-token-launch/]

Dependency Name: Helius
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Enhanced RPC, DAS API, Geyser streaming, webhooks for Dashboard, Indexer, and Rollup Sequencer access to Solana state
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Helius
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Backend, Dashboard Indexer, Rollup Sequencer, Wallet Integration
Sources
(HIGH) [Helius Blog, https://www.helius.dev/blog/grass-integration]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/developers/rpc]; [Twitter, https://x.com/heliuslabs]

Dependency Name: Triton One
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: High-performance Solana RPC provider for low-latency transaction submission and state reads
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Triton One
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Backend, Rollup Sequencer, Dashboard API
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Triton One, https://triton.one/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/infrastructure-partners/]; [Twitter, https://x.com/triton_one]

Dependency Name: Pyth Network
Dependency Type: Oracle
Purpose: GRASS/USD price feed for staking rewards calculation, DeFi integrations, and potential rollup slashing conditions
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Pyth Network
Related Technology Component: Staking Program, DeFi Integrations (Kamino, Drift), Rollup Verifier
Sources
(HIGH) [Pyth Network, https://pyth.network/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/oracle]; [Pyth Price Feed ID, https://pyth.network/developers/price-feed-ids]

Dependency Name: Switchboard
Dependency Type: Oracle
Purpose: Decentralized oracle alternative for price feeds and verifiable randomness / data verification for rollup
Criticality: Medium
Status: Live / Planned Expansion
Related Entity: Switchboard
Related Technology Component: Rollup Verifier, VRF for Node Selection, Data Verification
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Switchboard, https://switchboard.xyz/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/oracle]; [Twitter, https://x.com/switchboard_xyz]

Dependency Name: Wormhole
Dependency Type: Bridge
Purpose: Cross-chain token bridging for GRASS to Ethereum, Arbitrum, Base, Polygon (token portability only, not consensus)
Criticality: Medium
Status: Planned / Live (Token Bridge)
Related Entity: Wormhole
Related Technology Component: Token Bridge Contracts, GRASS SPL Token (Wormhole wrapped)
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Wormhole, https://wormhole.com/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/token-bridging/]; [Wormhole Explorer, https://explorer.wormhole.com/]

Dependency Name: AWS / Google Cloud Platform (GCP)
Dependency Type: Cloud
Purpose: Hosting Coordinator microservices, Kubernetes clusters (EKS/GKE), databases (PostgreSQL, Redis, ClickHouse), Kafka, monitoring
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Amazon Web Services; Google Cloud Platform
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Service, API Gateway, Indexer, Analytics Pipeline, Mobile Push Services
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/tech-stack/]; [Job Listings Wynd Labs, https://jobs.lever.co/wyndlabs]; [General Industry Practice]

Dependency Name: Kubernetes (K8s)
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Container orchestration for Coordinator, Indexer, RPC proxies, auto-scaling ingestion endpoints
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF)
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Backend, Rollup Sequencer (Future), Analytics Stack
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/tech-stack/]; [CNCF Landscape, https://landscape.cncf.io/]; [General Industry Practice]

Dependency Name: Apache Kafka / Redis Streams
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Message queue for scraping task distribution from Coordinator to Nodes, real-time event streaming for point calculation
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Apache Software Foundation; Redis
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Service, Node Clients (Desktop, Extension, Mobile, Lite), Point Calculation Engine
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/how-grass-works/]; [Kafka Docs, https://kafka.apache.org/]; [Redis Streams, https://redis.io/docs/data-types/streams/]

Dependency Name: PostgreSQL / Redis / ClickHouse
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Relational DB (User, Node, Epoch, Points), Cache/Rate-limit/Session, Analytics OLAP (Bandwidth logs, scraping metrics)
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: PostgreSQL Global Development Group; Redis; ClickHouse Inc.
Related Technology Component: Coordinator Backend, Dashboard API, Analytics Dashboard
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/tech-stack/]; [Job Listings Wynd Labs, https://jobs.lever.co/wyndlabs]; [General Industry Practice]

Dependency Name: IPFS / Arweave
Dependency Type: Data Provider
Purpose: Permanent storage for raw scraping payloads, provenance metadata, NFT badge metadata (CIDs anchored on-chain)
Criticality: Medium
Status: Partial Live (IPFS for NFTs), Full Integration Planned
Related Entity: Protocol Labs (IPFS); Arweave
Related Technology Component: Data Storage Interface, NFT Badge Metadata, Rollup Data Availability
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-nfts/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/data-availability]; [IPFS, https://ipfs.tech/]; [Arweave, https://www.arweave.org/]

Dependency Name: RISC Zero / SP1 (Succinct)
Dependency Type: Protocol
Purpose: ZK-VM for generating validity proofs of scraping execution in Sovereign Data Rollup (Planned)
Criticality: High (Future)
Status: Research & Development / Devnet
Related Entity: RISC Zero; Succinct
Related Technology Component: ZK Prover Module, Rollup Executor, Verifier Program on Solana
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [RISC Zero, https://www.risczero.com/]; [SP1, https://www.succinct.xyz/]

Dependency Name: Intel TDX / AMD SEV
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) attestation for verifiable scraping execution (Alternative/Complement to ZK)
Criticality: High (Future)
Status: Research & Development
Related Entity: Intel; AMD
Related Technology Component: TEE Attestation Module, Rollup Executor, Verifier Program
