(LOW) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Intel TDX, https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/tools/trust-domain-extensions/overview.html]; [AMD SEV, https://www.amd.com/en/technologies/sev.html]

