Purpose: NFT standard for Grass Badges (Soulbound), Epoch achievements, loyalty tokens on Solana
Criticality: Medium
Status: Live
Related Entity: Metaplex
Related Technology Component: NFT Badge Program, Dashboard Claiming, Tensor/Magic Eden Integration
Sources
(HIGH) [Metaplex Docs, https://docs.metaplex.com/]; [Solscan Grass NFT Collections, https://solscan.io/collection/...]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-nfts/]

